escription":"Akane_Battle_Covered_1","category":"battle","text":"这个位置不错。","text_original":"うふふっ、良い位置ですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/NwEbcKPkvs5qIBwvmPIqvzFXXfxtILqn.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_Damage_1","category":"battle","text":"啊，这就有点……","text_original":"うん...これはちょと....","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/4BuOLIR7SWZu6e951ezWiCDODlsLShzx.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_Damage_2","category":"battle","text":"啊……难办了。","text_original":"あ....困りましたね","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/ir1EtrSD98D2cLTceJCR3KHb9H6bNWVM.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_Damage_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"ああ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/IWJ5FBHNPvqvdFz0WM3v1S2sE4mryDHa.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_Defense_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"うふふっ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/AGTaDtC0I1GKbnaKowdNFhGEhAFXl8mq.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_In_1","category":"battle","text":"请交给我吧，能和主人在一起，正是我工作的动力所在。","text_original":"お任せください。ご主人様とご一緒することこそ、私のやりがいですから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/5frJJqi1OR1vRGUcayNoioZCYB0YX22p.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_In_2","category":"battle","text":"来吧各位，干净利落地执行歼灭任务吧。","text_original":"さあ、皆さん綺麗に、気持ち良く、殲滅して差し上げます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/37pEoGSqSTGuIgmByIkDdzZOt1yA7uZ3.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_Move_1","category":"battle","text":"呵呵，这里也打扫干净了。","text_original":"うふっ、ここも綺麗になりましたね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/gefbLYqvuNgT4rAiIjpGa6ljOoruAWzM.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_Move_2","category":"battle","text":"去下一个地方打扫吧。","text_original":"次の掃除に向かいましょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/31xk85VhQFbn7WxDekyNkUtKrzQJA3ps.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_Recovery_1","category":"battle","text":"哎呀，手法不错。","text_original":"あら、気が利きますね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/xNmmXX9PGKMH7vk9jSMvnSPSu15U2uu0.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_Retire","category":"battle","text":"主人，非常抱歉，这次是我的过失。","text_original":"申し訳ございません、ご主人様。今回のことは私の過失でした……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/CzUPyorWhGnQ9ELIA0AjR52s9zBQqyyI.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_Shout_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"えい","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/fZC9JjcrSRvD9F5gfjrr70hUjSQBZxr6.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_Shout_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"あらあら","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/bVbf0viOsiNKeoiR25TgHE8fjjF8HmIq.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_Shout_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"はあ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/6ppUdlZmRDpXvscDuw4FWHJgyxDHWu36.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_TacticalAction_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"よいしょっ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/XhUNY2wcaHGU1WMCVFlv8WmdEJBprVhu.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_Victory_1","category":"battle","text":"将胜利作为礼物献给主人，这是我的责任和使命。","text_original":"ご主人様に勝利をプレゼントすること、それが私の責任であり、任務です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/U4MN7rbBfFc2dpKHsDA86PXRFRCclglL.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Battle_Victory_2","category":"battle","text":"一切都是为了主人。","text_original":"全てはご主人様のため…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/364ePijzsrIj68Igf5my25TbLzj9ii6d.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Cafe_Act_1","category":"cafe","text":"欢迎光临。是否需要给您端上一杯热红茶呢？","text_original":"ようこそいらっしゃいました。 温かい紅茶を一杯、ご用意いたしましょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/BJqBdLcvwm7esjOpMHchUwVEfWJjWk0a.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Cafe_Act_2","category":"cafe","text":"主人、老师，还是……达令？呵呵。您喜欢我怎么称呼您呢？","text_original":"ご主人様、先生、もしくは…ダーリン？ ふふっ。どのようにお呼びするのがお好きでしょうか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/GkISLJ6L94lq99gDxOZqPlooPPrxGUUW.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Cafe_Act_3","category":"cafe","text":"哎呀，这些……应该是我来做的事情……这样一来，我就更有动力了，我·的·主·人。","text_original":"あら。これは…私がやるべきことでしたのに…。 さらにやる気になってしまいましたよ。 ご・主・人・様。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/nAijAtoCyLgBJptMSFq0Ja65kvaYcgw2.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"这里打扫得真干净。看来这里一定有个很能干的女仆随时待命。","text_original":"この場所はきれいに掃除されてますね。 有能なメイドが待機しているに違いないです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/sxALXzwItT7G1EvnjIGLmQo9wMtoB2Q0.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"您说减肥是吗……我曾经也有一段时间因为那些问题烦恼过，呵呵。","text_original":"ダイエットですか…。 一時、そういうことで悩んでいた時期もありましたね。ふふっ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/K2Z1drkMRJLQVPj3iyAV3CoTe4AO8PeR.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"哎呀，原来，您在那里呀。","text_original":"あら、そちらにいらっしゃいましたか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/15ecg59f39ThbjNCTiPtwO4LZj0SS13L.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"为主人，消除障碍吧。","text_original":"ご主人様の邪魔者を、排除する…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/Fd5EJTmbO6MB07bYvWavT8aAVy2V9adv.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"哎呀，那我们，就开始打扫吧。","text_original":"あら、それでは、掃除を始めましょうか…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/br7ZiOJqlcAyBIWVo8faJEJ5jqaXck75.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"请看，目标，马上就会消失了。","text_original":"ご覧になって。標的は、消えますよ…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/IICAlMiJG0Zyw3sTbgySd4svjdBo8Sj5.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"优雅的消除掉吧。","text_original":"優雅に、排除いたします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/NTs0OcgFIYLWywzi9qPPF7uSCenfwdrN.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"扫除的工作就劳烦各位了。","text_original":"皆さん、お掃除、お願いしますね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/cXujFR0omS9EN0IBeg5piAEKTs6nr5Kp.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"诚心诚意的拜托各位了，再会。","text_original":"丁寧にお願いいたしますね、さようなら。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/J5atai2KoUxIxXJm2gcISNT0kdRnfEeQ.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"受到期待，竟令我如此心潮澎湃。小茜会以最周到的侍奉来回应主人。","text_original":"期待されるとは、こんなにもときめくことだったのですね。 アカネは、ご主人様に最高のご奉仕で応えます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/h2nIjCs5pJTebLAQK5LflceY6vjrUBgK.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"好，那么，就开始提供服务吧。","text_original":"さあ、それではご奉仕を始めましょうか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/D5yblpPFwWJe0QkhSHHUu592MKI1pfJn.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"予主人以挚爱，予敌人以铁锤。这就是C&C提供的服务。","text_original":"ご主人様に愛を、敵には鉄槌を、それがC&Cのご奉仕なんです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/8j7jEZ99Fx18rnzdFXgOcXxLhhRkLibi.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Formation_Select","category":"formation","text":"我会竭诚为您服务。","text_original":"誠心誠意お仕えします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/RzLqfsAliQsLiui8SjmrPRyeIGCwPAkY.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我在此立下约定，将会提供最周到的协助，并向主人致意。","text_original":"最高のご奉仕をお約束し、 ご主人様へのご挨拶と致します。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/U0iqVdFqonm3tQyc044pil6rFIHooDTN.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"这样一来，就能提供更完美的服务了。","text_original":"これでより完璧なご奉仕が、可能になりましたね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/aKwZTAUt9eXqiqY9cdN6poIJxzmhNNtF.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"小茜，会满足主人的期望。","text_original":"アカネは、ご主人様のご期待にお応えします！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/F5Bo3KfAYnEVGIGFvBaga9WD9Aj3aCeC.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"请主人期待吧，今后，小茜的服务，将会和以往不同。","text_original":"ご期待ください、ご主人様。これからのアカネは、一味違いますから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/64012IOb5kGWycC2UnqVUMsqgtN4rJDU.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"今后，小茜一定会让主人百分之一百的满意。","text_original":"これからのアカネはきっと、ご主人様を100%満足させられることでしょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/YRpl9XvGvEkzS6bmCXkeiPfdNcKzMDM9.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"好的。文件我都整理好了。放心交给我吧。","text_original":"はい。書類は私が片づけておきました。 お任せください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/3yEedrzA0SpA0NUGx7bi4SDQCzrvUj6G.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"您有何吩咐？我会提供最周到的协助。","text_original":"何かお望みでしょうか。 最高のご奉仕で、お応えします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/HjS2l4kmh9ogWs11ZUjwsZ3gUPAOrAY8.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"老师是，我的主人对吧。C&C的小茜，再度向您献上问候。","text_original":"先生がわたしのご主人様ですね。 C&Cのアカネ。改めてご挨拶申し上げます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/qn3soBHpOaYC35FuJXei1py2PG0ivRZa.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"来了一封信。 哎呀，好可爱的字迹。 需·要·为·您·念·一·下·吗？","text_original":"手紙が届きました。 あら、可愛い字ですね。  お・読・み・い・た・し・ ま・しょ・う・か？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/d6R6p4VuQXm8XZIflo0HM2i3GgQiP3d7.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"这个请求或许稍欠优雅。但是，主人。 希望您以后，也能召唤小茜。","text_original":"優雅な願いではないかもしれません。 でも、ご主人様。これからもアカネを お呼びください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/S6DaddICNTCPNZ8TAbaKf57KaR2bpgRZ.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"您回来了，主人。今天也辛苦您了。","text_original":"おかえりなさいませ、ご主人様。 今日もお疲れ様でした。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/PLcJt4XPOLmPqolyGbEtlt9JcAPmbUQX.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"是否需要用茶呢？刚好来了一批顶级的茶叶。","text_original":"お茶でもいかがでしょうか？ ちょうど最高級の茶葉が入りましたよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/vmmgOmWkJumamAxnZeME08s3rSRMacvv.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"哎呀，老师，欢迎回家。","text_original":"あら。おかえりなさいませ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/nugnxLEgMQsqSW4l1kFYEbm4FhknqWZv.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"不知这一天，您过得怎么样呢？","text_original":"今日一日、いかがでしたか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/WZvkFQAB5BsKkzwKwcgpKb8fur4jnVGc.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"对了，主人。今天，我们刚好进了一批最高品质的茶叶。","text_original":"あ、ご主人様。ちょうど最高級の茶葉が入りましたよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/C6usoH8snL8BZPRzvsdt33vbUjZSOfNO.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"是否需要我来为您沏上一杯品品味道呢？","text_original":"私の方で一杯、 ご用意いたしましょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/2EeBZiTzYTUnEbFw8wgHrxqualFrIumQ.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_MemorialLobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"什么？您说这个地方并不是我们两个的家？","text_original":"はい？ここは、私たちのお家ではないですって？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/sPhyWfkDrChILBDmQPIq4052rZmFOWfW.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵，这不重要。","text_original":"ふふっ。気にしません。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/YB5P8xULVA2JlTfv15E0iFXlexVh5aAc.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"虽然这里并不是我们的家，但重要的是，我们现在陪伴着彼此啊。","text_original":"私たちのお家ではなくても、 私たちは今一緒にいるのですから","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/TBXg1jZ6BU9mUsi5xtl3mNMf62nF7v1M.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"我是C&C的小茜，谨向主人献上侍奉。","text_original":"C&Cのアカネ。謹んでご主人様にご奉仕を捧げます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/WMGAc3apfaHaPuGKNRszRdBxR1PoOOWo.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"哎呀，您在，担心我吗？呵呵，我很高兴。","text_original":"あら、私を心配してくださるのですか？うふ、嬉しいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/pcreZFaoHnBUgds5t2M89djqpxv674qB.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"我这是怎么了呢？竟然控制不住自己的笑意。是因为，主人在我的身边吗？","text_original":"どうしてでしょう？笑いが止まりません。ご主人様がそばにいるから、でしょうか…？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/LGr7q56Wi4vHke40mAQTRm3uywgyZgCO.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"我之所以会侍奉主人，并不是因为主人是老师，我是因为主人您，才成为女仆的。","text_original":"ご主人様は先生だからご奉仕しているわけではありません。ご主人様だから私はメイドになれました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/6I5rsAHjq5AogT0szG45us90zbx4exFd.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"诞生，就是祝福。 从遇到主人的那个瞬间起，我就一直心怀感恩。","text_original":"生誕は、祝福です。 ご主人様に出会ったその瞬間から、私はその事にいつも感謝していました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/UgPRzvViM771xkAFm3HUpknMoPWJfVLI.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"祝您生日快乐。主人。 主人大驾光临…… ……我感到很开心。","text_original":"お誕生日おめでとうございます。ご主人様。 ご主人様がここに来てくださって……嬉しいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/CRmqlgmCfbIfTqsyks717Ylz8zCdgSYu.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Season_Halloween","category":"lobby","text":"好啦。不给我糖的话，我就要捣蛋咯？ 其实，我更喜欢捣蛋呢。","text_original":"さあ。飴をくれないと、いたずらしますよ～？ 私は、いたずらの方が 好きですけどね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/1L4T0916q452DmoCmrjD4gccewacsONd.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"恭祝新春快乐～~ 今年也请多多关照。主人！","text_original":"明けましておめでとうございま～～っす。 今年一年も、よろしくお願いします。ご主人様！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/eaaJ4tJjMPb3iqpw5C52qr72yjRGXZo5.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞快乐~ 我送您的礼物，就是最周到的协助和最真诚的笑容。 那么，老师送我的礼物又是什么呢？","text_original":"メリークリスマス～。 私からのプレゼントは、最高のご奉仕と笑顔です。 先生からのプレゼントは何ですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/gbPGpVW6qRfbdGRPOVB9cjf8sVMyL2DZ.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Tactic_Defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"这还真是出乎意料呢。","text_original":"あら、これが予想外ですね…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/NTR2GL1fok1mKaPaOo8hT59priiiEkD0.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Tactic_Defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"要是我能做得更出色的话……","text_original":"私がもっと上手くできていったら…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/t79L3iZnNLdOFV1BDywaEy8TN6Rd1DPq.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Tactic_In_1","category":"battle","text":"原来如此，绝妙的判断。","text_original":"なるほど、見事なご判断です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/i01YtDulTv9tv74cm0NFsI0lwRwubwRb.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Tactic_In_2","category":"battle","text":"好了，那我们就开始吧，现在是大扫除的时间了。","text_original":"さあ、それでは始めましょうか。お掃除の時間です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/LeBl1LzcTba5sJ5Fv3yDDbwEulMBmueW.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Tactic_Victory_1","category":"battle","text":"优雅地取胜，这就是我的责任和义务。","text_original":"優雅に勝利すること、それが私の責任であり、義務です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/zfRI29G6LsSd018HhU9ZYikFY7x4ZTaV.ogg"},{"description":"Akane_Tactic_Victory_2","category":"battle","text":"不愧是我的主人啊。","text_original":"さすが、わたしのご主人様ですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/fItjB0HbAYyZl4Ljqu4p76TAakVD0Pt4.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"akane_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/original/akane_title.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_buffed_1","category":"battle","text":"哎呀，非常感谢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/AR4W4R59uwKgyOhzuauH2KMrJVGzBTkz.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_buffself_1","category":"battle","text":"好，该上啰。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/VHDOjqgUK0cAleDpjxksZpOKjsvFTqYR.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_covered_1","category":"battle","text":"这个位置不错。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/R6XrJVlv1faVtqxm3ko8HmuIBOU0uOF9.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_damage_1","category":"battle","text":"啊，这就有点……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/hx6IrODi7pABR0KXqIxvc5XksRCF0d0g.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_damage_2","category":"battle","text":"啊……难办了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/kjaMtGVV2JEChS8xe7rxa22ArJ077Qnj.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_damage_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/iBOy56wgvBiRYSaeOqHaINDxlMzfzdR7.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_defense_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/TbylyGbTWGLPN3043NeMdQJjKFDhf7Jt.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_in_1","category":"battle","text":"请交给我吧，能和主人在一起，正是我工作的动力所在。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/p1wDhgwASDuKY3Psz1LrAVgGngPWfrSN.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_in_2","category":"battle","text":"来吧各位，干净利落地执行歼灭任务吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/MqV8nhDfuMLogrnDKuWdR1tKP0bvpRJE.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_move_1","category":"battle","text":"呵呵，这里也打扫干净了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/Zb9TzS6GHqbikfTtqwGTSNs2iouVFFn0.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_move_2","category":"battle","text":"去下一个地方打扫吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/KPJdlMgUQW1eVOG8ZU447eJjtguxvUhd.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_recovery_1","category":"battle","text":"哎呀，手法不错。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/JywYEBm3nXZFaXMnrqcdC39rQgXuQ0IT.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_retire","category":"battle","text":"主人，非常抱歉，这次是我的过失。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/ZiZEhxU9Gbld02TPLKhpWIoTjJHy3pue.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_shout_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/m093sXXKaVKLcmAtQJtEIvyoyr6QVY8n.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_shout_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/L3JiAvp9Gww4VfQhCeQcxCSwTPMOuYyy.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_shout_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/l3F5pEFBIx2bDCSJtEXVM4J94OJC6Iq3.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_tacticalaction_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/weFFThQeVg96qrjTHIm7ExtEzN5jRuXa.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"将胜利作为礼物献给主人，这是我的责任和使命。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/JVMeYSuySCNPtibvN3HFA3liv59Jae6N.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"一切都是为了主人。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/u5uPtDGsCImvP6iobtFeT0E4mq0AfBOB.ogg"},{"description":"akane_cafe_act_1","category":"cafe","text":"欢迎光临。是否需要给您端上一杯热红茶呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/Uh1oZajSbtVZa9iZbRSKqtPzJpKeb7uD.ogg"},{"description":"akane_cafe_act_2","category":"cafe","text":"主人、老师，还是……达令？呵呵。您喜欢我怎么称呼您呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/JGMt4CYrqatWHlHCaPZVsRK1ucp93rGd.ogg"},{"description":"akane_cafe_act_3","category":"cafe","text":"哎呀，这些……应该是我来做的事情……这样一来，我就更有动力了，我·的·主·人。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/61EQnABmRfhYXJVFj7xizshLqYQpWLXn.ogg"},{"description":"akane_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"这里打扫得真干净。看来这里一定有个很能干的女仆随时待命。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/eKuYKKPMxZz4ggX6c59cpEczBnP9hEOm.ogg"},{"description":"akane_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"您说减肥是吗……我曾经也有一段时间因为那些问题烦恼过，呵呵。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/RUvk2VmTcOGKbMIPCCbgWlbAxohtJl0f.ogg"},{"description":"akane_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"哎呀，原来，您在那里呀。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/1iRTKzxARtPR7eWcbpe5V1M0YFYws07H.ogg"},{"description":"akane_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"为主人，消除障碍吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/Y9xFTAcwp4xiQ5xMPJTenVPZWA0n7E4f.ogg"},{"description":"akane_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"哎呀，那我们，就开始打扫吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/5wg1ZbPJXzY0CGaoOKBj8Yfo8QMyZIpd.ogg"},{"description":"akane_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"请看，目标，马上就会消失了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/lkazsLn8lNWbKM53bdwQaI1XGBfjLtfH.ogg"},{"description":"akane_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"优雅的消除掉吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/3UEVMoEB5PFufwrH8Pl6DLbQmM8khfc9.ogg"},{"description":"akane_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"扫除的工作就劳烦各位了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/jxEOiMhmxNGNR14Z6mnHRxYoKU975CGe.ogg"},{"description":"akane_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"诚心诚意的拜托各位了，再会。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/6TPRRi8pISpVe5z3uRe5U3ln1SY1LkE5.ogg"},{"description":"akane_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"受到期待，竟令我如此心潮澎湃。小茜会以最周到的侍奉来回应主人。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/aDZyecwNlFHQHJA2XiCjk7IJzsLRgOMW.ogg"},{"description":"akane_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"好，那么，就开始提供服务吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/jEAG4vhGfmzotbIftZA3OEOaVx72qkPy.ogg"},{"description":"akane_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"予主人以挚爱，予敌人以铁锤。这就是C&C提供的服务。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/FP0QttPG88jwGxACPtwlZnBXRv6ptfWM.ogg"},{"description":"akane_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"我会竭诚为您服务。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/FFBMF1LAwz9AigFsLXUbMoysUtTsJxlJ.ogg"},{"description":"akane_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我在此立下约定，将会提供最周到的协助，并向主人致意。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/xoey0sHMRJZIOSrVHIgfEKbEzuTu1rK4.ogg"},{"description":"akane_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"这样一来，就能提供更完美的服务了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/nJyG6aqe1ZcnavgQDJP8MnfaoCF65Koc.ogg"},{"description":"akane_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"小茜，会满足主人的期望。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/oABm5o3yFkEWGZvXSWt7Qak4THhUxMYO.ogg"},{"description":"akane_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"请主人期待吧，今后，小茜的服务，将会和以往不同。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/w6OSHPFk6iHlDwxifHnwU4xR9QFyATYo.ogg"},{"description":"akane_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"今后，小茜一定会让主人百分之一百的满意。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/XnWLNaDrPNQDHUMARtPw2oXdQqUiZcex.ogg"},{"description":"akane_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"好的。文件我都整理好了。放心交给我吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/0tYXpNkNvdo35ApKcMlKicBfpj97cIAK.ogg"},{"description":"akane_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"您有何吩咐？我会提供最周到的协助。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/w7c1k6g2u71yixWjyfLGMOQGuzc4AToW.ogg"},{"description":"akane_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"老师是，我的主人对吧。C&C的小茜，再度向您献上问候。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/YTFkwWxOTmYMhqd9nzlAgDpp9pVgn9ZX.ogg"},{"description":"akane_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"来了一封信。 哎呀，好可爱的字迹。 需·要·为·您·念·一·下·吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/G167PXhm0L0akHFcn0FzaIVmG3VnX7ie.ogg"},{"description":"akane_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"这个请求或许稍欠优雅。但是，主人。 希望您以后，也能召唤小茜。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/bogYdScKpEHgJMwbtB7SXm3wpCwVRNUb.ogg"},{"description":"akane_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"您回来了，主人。今天也辛苦您了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/AOUlIqvIoL7xBrXUjrE8unSbtLl15lxZ.ogg"},{"description":"akane_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"是否需要用茶呢？刚好来了一批顶级的茶叶。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/7t4ktsXhCBveaUJpin5un8gpUAkFdxhD.ogg"},{"description":"akane_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"哎呀，老师，欢迎回家。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/ImBI4rBW7X45Km3yGWNtuRQiYP4smT8I.ogg"},{"description":"akane_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"不知这一天，您过得怎么样呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/M4Y50d4RAC6TKPOrLu8l38OASR15ZcEi.ogg"},{"description":"akane_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"对了，主人。今天，我们刚好进了一批最高品质的茶叶。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/jcdaYcwJaJSdFAs4zk1hUPAEWoDQw5Vs.ogg"},{"description":"akane_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"是否需要我来为您沏上一杯品品味道呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/pjkrzLaSgN8Iz5FbRD6dzsRREVVY1fEc.ogg"},{"description":"akane_memoriallobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"什么？您说这个地方并不是我们两个的家？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/3sz8swIDCUwUfZ0gkPquTvCGsUQGNnzb.ogg"},{"description":"akane_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵，这不重要。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/N70obcLEvtfyMMEL2GxJfoN80SmUbDkc.ogg"},{"description":"akane_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"虽然这里并不是我们的家，但重要的是，我们现在陪伴着彼此啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/VBOfUuo9MhnLUtaRW30QuX1aac5nS1pw.ogg"},{"description":"akane_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"我是C&C的小茜，谨向主人献上侍奉。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/mBFjK5e3Y0pPJzYPtQ5bLbCZUZemiIkv.ogg"},{"description":"akane_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"哎呀，您在，担心我吗？呵呵，我很高兴。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/OkX0LD3FAI9nFdv60ADDKWf4dNCGz0Ik.ogg"},{"description":"akane_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"我这是怎么了呢？竟然控制不住自己的笑意。是因为，主人在我的身边吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/jUf1AdmS9HfpF4gVUJPl3NPeusXnQsNk.ogg"},{"description":"akane_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"我之所以会侍奉主人，并不是因为主人是老师，我是因为主人您，才成为女仆的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/yzTW2Frgb3xIn7TXAq0BMUkC6HaP6c8o.ogg"},{"description":"akane_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"诞生，就是祝福。 从遇到主人的那个瞬间起，我就一直心怀感恩。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/7PxSfDzwEyGMh4r9SBqQLMDdNbrZfw1b.ogg"},{"description":"akane_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"祝您生日快乐。主人。 主人大驾光临…… ……我感到很开心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/vpy049z9Tz1w5S4S08aH1WzUghTq6Rrk.ogg"},{"description":"akane_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"好啦。不给我糖的话，我就要捣蛋咯？ 其实，我更喜欢捣蛋呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/5XYzRy7DEZdryEtdeANmvEWGPggyOIdQ.ogg"},{"description":"akane_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"恭祝新春快乐～~ 今年也请多多关照。主人！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/MMoweDSny3L1QIBMYmzly7Z3KsYgNYVS.ogg"},{"description":"akane_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞快乐~ 我送您的礼物，就是最周到的协助和最真诚的笑容。 那么，老师送我的礼物又是什么呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/6aCDLEqYjLGMeGC5P35txs63QMjElikz.ogg"},{"description":"akane_tactic_defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"这还真是出乎意料呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/RhKmBOB9DvWI77O9VszMuZH1VvCrY4mV.ogg"},{"description":"akane_tactic_defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"要是我能做得更出色的话……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/2QWc7DvJGBlWK2rRik5Z6DXVqprpwRZv.ogg"},{"description":"akane_tactic_in_1","category":"battle","text":"原来如此，绝妙的判断。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/XpQa85WEC38aRWrBI9WEszKmgt4fSKYV.ogg"},{"description":"akane_tactic_in_2","category":"battle","text":"好了，那我们就开始吧，现在是大扫除的时间了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/VjJE2Bnhf5KSVPCmRJe4lCgYyTSisyHI.ogg"},{"description":"akane_tactic_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"优雅地取胜，这就是我的责任和义务。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/RUbwyDeXrmaksVHMoSUMrm4UvNZdmznc.ogg"},{"description":"akane_tactic_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"不愧是我的主人啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/KjvmuMFYbiWlp44f0BqF2sX0NgGdpdXh.ogg"},{"description":"akane_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"祝主人新春快乐。小茜今年也愿意继续伴您左右。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/G2T0BuRdcgNeMKb0vLUJcnAOIIniboPN.ogg"},{"description":"akane_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"红茶配上月饼……这样的中秋夜，也别有一番意境呢，主人。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/MhEmBUSDhYHZABVCZ4kCkJ4KKUxgRV4q.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"akane_battle_in_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/original/akane_battle_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"akane_battle_move_1","category":"battl